
<p>John Brayton:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Unread 5.0 is <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/unread-an-rss-reader/id1363637349">available now from the App Store</a>. This update adds these improvements and more:</p>

<ul>
<li>Improvements around hero images, article list thumbnails, and widget thumbnails</li>
<li>Syncing with FreshRSS and Miniflux</li>
<li>The ability to quickly mark old articles read</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>

<p>I’m a NetNewsWire man personally, but I’ve <a href="https://daringfireball.net/linked/2020/03/20/unread-2">long admired Unread</a> as a different, very good take on a feed reader. Just a gorgeous app. One of the very best things about RSS is that feed readers take such different shapes and approaches.</p>

